---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
description: Notes from Adesola Adesina on things I'm building and problems I've had to work through.
permalink: /blog/
---
<h1 class="page-title">Writing</h1>
<p class="lede">Notes on things I'm building and problems I've had to work through.</p>

{% set posts = collections.posts | reverse %}
{% if posts.length %}
<ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in posts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    {% if post.data.draft %}<span class="draft-flag inline">Draft</span>{% endif %}
    <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">First post coming soon.</p>
{% endif %}
